* Differential stage with an active mirror load; polarity is parameterized
<MODEL_SETUP>
Vdd vdd 0 <VDD>
Vbn bn 0 <BODY_N>
Vbp bp 0 <BODY_P>
Vinp inp 0 DC=<INP_DC> AC=<INP_AC> 0
Vinn inn 0 DC=<INN_DC> AC=<INN_AC> 0
Itail <TAIL_POS> <TAIL_NEG> <ACTIVE_TAIL_CURRENT>
<INPUT_PREFIX>in_l mirror inp tail <INPUT_BODY> <INPUT_DEVICE>
<INPUT_PREFIX>in_r out inn tail <INPUT_BODY> <INPUT_DEVICE>
<LOAD_PREFIX>load_d mirror mirror <LOAD_SOURCE> <LOAD_BODY> <LOAD_DEVICE>
<LOAD_PREFIX>load_o out mirror <LOAD_SOURCE> <LOAD_BODY> <LOAD_DEVICE>
Rhi vdd out 20k
Rlo out 0 20k
Cout out 0 <DIFFPAIR_CAP>
.temp <TEMP>
<ANALYSIS>
.end
